 an Alien》trailer——The most sweet ‘’Planet adventure”in the world\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":128167,\"title\":\"She Was Pretty\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mXvBLXsEnNxHvxFsAnLNPzpiegI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2858974358974359,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":94707,\"title\":\"The Love by Hypnotic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7TdSKz8lepKCFTxn7D4C6b6s55.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28346666666666664,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":280846,\"title\":\"传闻中的宁清漪\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sgJyl2BeVt232IAL0f5JSt0t6Eh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27692307692307694,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yUU3uDpAcnyEpsIYMtvuYjW84ra.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2019-08-19\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Chai Xiaoqi, an alien from Cape Town, crash-lands on Earth. She meets Fang Leng, a CEO with emotional control issues, and saves him from danger.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qVHUi17PB4XkJ7F219MJEgCECno.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":7,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-19\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Chai Xiaoqi tries to adapt to Earth life while searching for her communication device. Fang Leng investigates her background, growing increasingly intrigued by her unusual behavior.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/olTT59NCRssjjgLl5K7oAnBQdBm.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-19\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi starts working at Fang Leng's company. Her alien abilities cause both amazement and confusion among her coworkers. Fang Leng's ex-girlfriend appears, creating tension.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vP4fVDI87VpJrZgJu2tiyAiN8cm.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-20\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi's alien nature leads to comical misunderstandings at work. Fang Leng begins to develop feelings for her despite his emotional barriers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yzrWY7B9kVBolD6hThYo4OdqZir.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-20\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"A rival company tries to poach Xiaoqi for her unique skills. Fang Leng becomes protective, realizing his growing attachment to her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ewwDiStIQgkJF8MnXflSNlmWhI5.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-26\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi's alien powers malfunction, causing chaos at a company event. Fang Leng helps cover for her, deepening their bond.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yVsJOQvgg1O3jZTOywgycwtuCsk.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-26\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng's family pressures him about marriage. Xiaoqi inadvertently impresses his family, leading to unexpected complications.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9HPmFyBoTkFH1WB35ifZ1LyfVmm.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-27\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi learns more about human emotions and relationships. She and Fang Leng grow closer as he teaches her about Earth customs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A17NhiZ6ZvCnlqUpQ7Sqnfo6zfC.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-27\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"A misunderstanding leads Xiaoqi to believe she and Fang Leng are in a relationship. Comedic situations ensue as she acts on this assumption.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gyCgSB4xx8s4v1Mzc2MkUp17ddn.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-02\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng's ex-girlfriend schemes to separate him and Xiaoqi. Xiaoqi's alien nature helps her navigate the situation uniquely.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7IaLvPNBot9LUt7EqC83UQwRCDM.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-02\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi's alien identity is nearly exposed during a company retreat. Fang Leng protects her secret, bringing them closer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jTbKW7O4tfUn4HV1Wv30dh1MUH3.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-03\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng struggles with his growing feelings for Xiaoqi. A business rival creates problems, which Xiaoqi helps solve using her alien abilities.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9GIKF5awdsh7RUT4qIn9B97uNiV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-03\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi experiences jealousy for the first time when Fang Leng interacts with other women. She learns about human romantic customs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bQRg3be9pEfyNxIlYsGOpZ35jhC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-09\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng's emotional barriers begin to crumble as he spends more time with Xiaoqi. A misunderstanding leads to a near-confession.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ueqz9X8JhgJGBJp4AkChLzBarNv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-09\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi's communication device is briefly activated, reminding her of her mission to return home. She becomes conflicted about her feelings for Earth and Fang Leng.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nUK1FNezBz0KnTWecJlX706TRs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng's family interferes in his relationship with Xiaoqi. She uses her alien charm to win them over, causing humorous situations.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Vrw8dHXRrnTIuPVBZtavsw24qr.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"A health scare for Fang Leng reveals the depth of Xiaoqi's feelings for him. She risks exposing her identity to help him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xc4u9Bvmvt7J9owPzNAQO32XyIT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-16\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi's alien nature causes problems at a crucial business meeting. Fang Leng covers for her, realizing how much he cares for her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f9xayRQsGjVy5sdgTYPN3tS2EuF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-16\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng finally confesses his feelings to Xiaoqi. Their relationship faces immediate challenges due to her alien identity.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wH2r4RBJSs7hyx4EF170yORVde6.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi struggles to keep her alien identity secret as her relationship with Fang Leng deepens. A rival alien appears, threatening her happiness.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wIgVRnnvcs3iRjDksXcNUuramMR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"The rival alien creates chaos, forcing Xiaoqi to use her powers more openly. Fang Leng becomes suspicious of her unusual abilities.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyih5CLGCh9mrRc1cuC2PqTCETm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi considers revealing her true identity to Fang Leng. A series of misunderstandings leads to tension in their relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lHQhc51IPwrbLiTheQ18ZgIniPS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-23\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng discovers evidence of Xiaoqi's alien nature. He struggles with disbelief and confusion about their relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jH35fjNAnpdFe3CcNI82WE4cDjV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi finally reveals her alien identity to Fang Leng. He must come to terms with this shocking revelation and decide about their future.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x0XocNTP6Uf73PdNMUqBhzVfc4S.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng accepts Xiaoqi's alien nature. They work together to fend off the rival alien threatening Earth and their relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mVuyT64B57powojFUMW6KNOfq8P.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Xiaoqi receives a signal from her home planet, forcing her to choose between staying on Earth with Fang Leng or returning home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f1PKE4ipoPwLGYxHq9FLnI4vPUc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"Fang Leng and Xiaoqi face their final challenge as they try to find a way for her to stay on Earth. Their friends and family rally to help.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4XGzuU1LGXPEsUHQ9HGI75B54zn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-01\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"My Girlfriend Is An Alien\",\"overview\":\"In the series finale, Xiaoqi and Fang Leng find a solution that allows them to be together. They celebrate their unique love that transcends galaxies.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iRBQxYGqEyt2anzDnvJMHJ2JqZi.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-01\",\"runtime\":45}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2019-08-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}